T1  - Development of the ‘Attentive Visitors’ workshop supporting community volunteers in their palliative care signposting role
AU  - Van Steenbergen, Sabet
AU  - Vanderstichelen, Steven
AU  - Statema, Else Gien
AU  - Deliens, Luc
AU  - Dury, Sarah
AU  - Chambaere, Kenneth
