T1  - Leveraging Canadian Health Care Worker Volunteers to Address COVID-19 Vaccine Misinformation on Facebook: Qualitative Program Evaluation Study
AU  - Ford, Caitlin
AU  - Hasan, Hinna
AU  - Fullerton, Madison
AU  - Wong, Janette
AU  - Pateman, Margaret
AU  - Chen, Hao Ming
AU  - Tang, Theresa
