T1  - Perceived organizational support on episodic volunteers' affective and behavioral outcomes: a case of the 2016 Rio Olympic Games
AU  - Won, Doyeon
AU  - Chiu, Weisheng
AU  - Bang, Hyejin
AU  - Bravo, Gonzalo A.
JO  - International Journal of Event and Festival Management
VL  - 12
