T1  - Perspectives on Volunteer-Professional Collaboration in Palliative Care: A Qualitative Study Among Volunteers, Patients, Family Carers, and Health Care Professionals
AU  - Vanderstichelen, Steven
AU  - Cohen, Joachim
AU  - Van Wesemael, Yanna
AU  - Deliens, Luc
AU  - Chambaere, Kenneth
JO  - Journal of Pain and Symptom Management
VL  - 58
