T1  - Effect of prednisone on woodsmoke-induced sputum inflammation in healthy volunteers: A randomized, placebo-controlled pilot study
AU  - Noah, Terry L.
AU  - Alexis, Neil E.
AU  - Bennett, William D.
AU  - Hernandez, Michelle L.
AU  - Burbank, Allison J.
AU  - Li, Haolin
