T1  - The effect of online CPR training on the knowledge and practice of the Red Crescent Student Association Volunteers during the COVID‐19 pandemic: A randomized clinical trial study
AU  - Salehpoor-Emran, Mohammad
AU  - Pashaeypoor, Shahzad
AU  - Majdabadi, Zahra Amrollah
AU  - Böttiger, Bernd W.
AU  - Poortaghi, Sarieh
